@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### All books

GET {{baseUrl}}/books

### Book with id 1

GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1

### Book that does not exist

GET {{baseUrl}}/books/999

### Books by Ada

GET {{baseUrl}}/books?author=Ada

### Author that does not exist

GET {{baseUrl}}/books?author=Nobody

### Challenge 1 — only available books

GET {{baseUrl}}/books?available=true

### Challenge 1 — only unavailable books

GET {{baseUrl}}/books?available=false

### Challenge 2 — author and availability at the same time

GET {{baseUrl}}/books?author=Ada&available=true

### Challenge 3 — sorted by year

GET {{baseUrl}}/books?sort=year

### Challenge 2 + 3 — filtered and sorted

GET {{baseUrl}}/books?available=true&sort=year
